window.EXAUD={"Can you add more words to the list?": "audio/cau/044b833c9e87b1a6.mp3", "Mi added sugar to her tea, but she removed the lemon.": "audio/cau/322ad3085fcba67a.mp3", "In addition, the city has many good schools.": "audio/cau/269ee7b7b45ea5db.mp3", "The new park is a nice addition; they will add trees.": "audio/cau/c95be8a71046b87c.mp3", "My teacher gave me additional support before the exam.": "audio/cau/840610a6aa60c4df.mp3", "Nam does additional exercises at home.": "audio/cau/e94d331c26e6fc48.mp3", "Additionally, cycling is good for your health.": "audio/cau/d272f7732d50fa22.mp3", "The room is big. Additionally, it is cheap.": "audio/cau/35125e1b6d5d1f88.mp3", "Can you say that again, please?": "audio/cau/7e3810543bbdcfd8.mp3", "Mi read the story again and again.": "audio/cau/1afa85aeab810227.mp3", "My aim is to speak English well.": "audio/cau/4e6cc3255e109d30.mp3", "The club aims to help poor children.": "audio/cau/2a4c4962cfadb256.mp3", "Minh sets his alarm for six o'clock every morning.": "audio/cau/baf0157cbdb5f2f6.mp3", "Hoa's alarm clock helps her get up on time.": "audio/cau/75acf70f1b209cca.mp3", "My parents allow me to play games at weekends.": "audio/cau/0e78db317452b06e.mp3", "The park doesn't allow bikes; it bans them.": "audio/cau/cf368ad5bb4a58ec.mp3", "My parents give me a weekly allowance.": "audio/cau/6f99a39b2452a943.mp3", "I save part of my allowance.": "audio/cau/ea79159a664a92e3.mp3", "It's almost time for lunch.": "audio/cau/2b8687581cfb164a.mp3", "Nam almost missed the bus; he was nearly late.": "audio/cau/6450f2937d81ad4c.mp3", "Lan likes music. She also likes drawing.": "audio/cau/a42927a6760bdc56.mp3", "Nam speaks English and also learns Japanese.": "audio/cau/d657bddc45a35d0d.mp3", "My mother always gets up early.": "audio/cau/018f205f8d900a21.mp3", "Nam always does his homework, but he never watches TV late.": "audio/cau/bed514ec413923ae.mp3", "I am a student at Kim Dong School.": "audio/cau/7c9effe742362b92.mp3", "I am in Class 6A, and my friends are in 6B.": "audio/cau/69bce6abc68e1822.mp3", "Please answer the teacher's question.": "audio/cau/f790ccdd60f40ece.mp3", "Nam asks and Hoa answers.": "audio/cau/128cffcafde831b9.mp3", "Check your answers with a partner.": "audio/cau/8656910f569b2925.mp3", "Lan can answer all the questions, and her answers are correct.": "audio/cau/df2a478d26596242.mp3", "We live in an apartment on the tenth floor.": "audio/cau/4e92ae5a41f11424.mp3", "Nam's family moved to a new flat in a big apartment building.": "audio/cau/9d5250ee060002c6.mp3", "Many people in the city live in apartments.": "audio/cau/9bf724316bf72e36.mp3", "Our apartment is small, but the other apartments are bigger.": "audio/cau/4f4fbeb000424176.mp3", "I use an app to learn English.": "audio/cau/8b5de3a8ea891fe1.mp3", "Lan downloaded a new app; this application helps her book taxis.": "audio/cau/1b345290c5e399e1.mp3", "The idea of a picnic is very appealing.": "audio/cau/d3ba308d53ccc5db.mp3", "The cake looks appealing.": "audio/cau/c306325113d90b74.mp3", "I use a learning application on my phone.": "audio/cau/a7b64e48119d1163.mp3", "She sent an application to the school.": "audio/cau/7ae0872ea7cda640.mp3", "My phone has many applications.": "audio/cau/fcd2fae9c5fe02cd.mp3", "AI has many applications in daily life.": "audio/cau/92606d44271a0b51.mp3", "There are many useful apps for students.": "audio/cau/03ccde264f0438bc.mp3", "This app is free, but those apps are expensive.": "audio/cau/70732b1ff6e3364d.mp3", "Mi and Nam are in Class 6A.": "audio/cau/b0d165e52ca7dc85.mp3", "We are happy today, and Lan is happy too.": "audio/cau/9718e7702bade08e.mp3", "You can ask your teacher for help.": "audio/cau/675c99f05fae3d5e.mp3", "Phong asked a question, and Mi answered it.": "audio/cau/ad374096f949206b.mp3", "Nam asked his teacher a question.": "audio/cau/4879a0b703b8484f.mp3", "Mi asks a lot of questions; yesterday she asked ten.": "audio/cau/1884bf7fdb16c86c.mp3", "Lan is asking her mother about dinner.": "audio/cau/28eda1c06b5eacae.mp3", "Nam asks a lot, and now he is asking again.": "audio/cau/c563c3f4819710c9.mp3", "Minh asks his friend for a pen.": "audio/cau/463760cf3bb33508.mp3", "Hoa often asks questions, and yesterday she asked ten.": "audio/cau/99ce048ae007844f.mp3", "The teacher assigned us a project.": "audio/cau/ffbe60e866161de7.mp3", "Each group is assigned a topic.": "audio/cau/f73eb27a86e0f920.mp3", "I want to know the due date for my history assignment.": "audio/cau/ecd8ccd822bc9cc5.mp3", "Our teacher gave us a group assignment.": "audio/cau/2a79b4a5712b6c35.mp3", "The shop assistant is very friendly.": "audio/cau/a154f19326268e60.mp3", "My phone has a voice assistant.": "audio/cau/4c4e5412c0038e10.mp3", "Beautiful beaches attract many tourists.": "audio/cau/4c43d9d7afbbf365.mp3", "Ha Long Bay attracts visitors because it is a famous attraction.": "audio/cau/aeb486068ea88223.mp3", "Hoan Kiem Lake is a popular attraction.": "audio/cau/94088e7e8cf750d8.mp3", "The night market attracts tourists and is a big attraction.": "audio/cau/5a512b8768f85428.mp3", "The city is attractive to young people.": "audio/cau/e65fd9dfdd0db098.mp3", "Bright lights attract visitors and make the street attractive.": "audio/cau/8bfc9fecd3006205.mp3", "Steve Jobs passed away in 2011.": "audio/cau/be8b92331608f7f3.mp3", "My school is 2 km away from my house.": "audio/cau/36a79be5031eac35.mp3", "Look at picture b and answer.": "audio/cau/b2672a8a1898ddda.mp3", "Write the letter b next to the right answer.": "audio/cau/9ec7b58bf879e0bc.mp3", "He came back to his village after the war.": "audio/cau/97697c4a9d748fa3.mp3", "Nam went to Hue and came back on Sunday.": "audio/cau/1bf8eb10f268125e.mp3", "The city was badly affected by the flood.": "audio/cau/1e256308778b183a.mp3", "Nam played badly today, but yesterday he played worse.": "audio/cau/c2078c45e0d95aa8.mp3", "The school bans phones in class.": "audio/cau/b0af45ee2d92cbd2.mp3", "Smoking is banned here.": "audio/cau/123fbc274f4b91a5.mp3", "Please be quiet in the library.": "audio/cau/d6fab02a2655be4e.mp3", "I want to be a doctor. My sister is a nurse.": "audio/cau/e31166f3ca032296.mp3", "Hoi An is a beautiful old town.": "audio/cau/e98bb193dd75aa2b.mp3", "Lan sings beautifully, and her voice is beautiful.": "audio/cau/4d5c5951771c97b1.mp3", "Our lessons begin at seven o'clock.": "audio/cau/7e2700abcf553879.mp3", "The film began at 8 p.m. and finished at 10 p.m.": "audio/cau/27d24f5e96b08bae.mp3", "Thank you for being so kind to me.": "audio/cau/a75c0878deadd1e7.mp3", "Being a doctor is hard, but my aunt is happy.": "audio/cau/4aa63f5a96fb8206.mp3", "Besides, I also tried to follow a healthy diet.": "audio/cau/8c6b708cf4c7209e.mp3", "Besides football, Nam plays badminton.": "audio/cau/75b5a2409b53f5fe.mp3", "Our school has a big garden.": "audio/cau/6b86817f41024790.mp3", "My house is big, but Minh's house is bigger.": "audio/cau/1d7d2b8d19284673.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is bigger than Da Nang.": "audio/cau/5efe9fe286047142.mp3", "My house is big, but Nam's house is bigger.": "audio/cau/44f8b6366001f6da.mp3", "This is the biggest market in the city.": "audio/cau/ba6358ef44b7b295.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is the biggest city in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/815c69dda42327e1.mp3", "I'm a bit tired today.": "audio/cau/42f3919d01ac7e5d.mp3", "Phong is a bit shy, but a little more confident now.": "audio/cau/8a006479d73a2609.mp3", "My cat has black fur.": "audio/cau/a0b2fea708bf6f41.mp3", "Mi has black hair and a white shirt.": "audio/cau/ccf0d3ad0aca7115.mp3", "We live in a block of flats.": "audio/cau/5b4eab8e0d0978c5.mp3", "Children play with wooden blocks.": "audio/cau/49047d5e7ff30738.mp3", "A tree is blocking the road.": "audio/cau/97ec314362974f31.mp3", "Your bike is blocking the door.": "audio/cau/f24bd7f61458c191.mp3", "Please bring your English book tomorrow.": "audio/cau/cd49561735d6690b.mp3", "Exams can bring about a lot of stress.": "audio/cau/4bcd1f108e558b55.mp3", "I go to school by bus.": "audio/cau/95f45bf1658e850f.mp3", "Lan takes the bus because the buses are cheap.": "audio/cau/362c3212b1a0dbc6.mp3", "The buses are crowded in the morning.": "audio/cau/4fa37117ae1e3e0c.mp3", "This bus is new, but the other buses are old.": "audio/cau/f4d42669f06842ed.mp3", "My mum is always busy at weekends.": "audio/cau/e860f8923617b0aa.mp3", "Hoa is busy today, but she is free tomorrow.": "audio/cau/1d5a0a62fb11072c.mp3", "The correct answer is c.": "audio/cau/115cc222c2d7fb6e.mp3", "Look at picture c and describe the girl.": "audio/cau/a211a53ea5c1cc24.mp3", "I call my grandparents every Sunday.": "audio/cau/2d274e78a6c843f7.mp3", "Mi phoned Lan, but Lan didn't answer the call.": "audio/cau/5828a7c8ea6b7c57.mp3", "The caller asked for my mother.": "audio/cau/3b0159f33675d877.mp3", "The first caller wins a prize.": "audio/cau/96bea6f7e7871b46.mp3", "Dad filmed my birthday with a camcorder.": "audio/cau/bde498a8030565b2.mp3", "This camcorder is very old.": "audio/cau/96cb6b480bbbdcce.mp3", "The first iPhone came in 2007.": "audio/cau/b74af45c313ce91a.mp3", "Lan came to my house, and then we went to the park.": "audio/cau/db2ce9de70166e15.mp3", "Mi can swim very well.": "audio/cau/3e8edac082144330.mp3", "I can ride a bike now, but last year I couldn't.": "audio/cau/af33705bbc26781d.mp3", "I can't find my pencil case.": "audio/cau/eb6d0d717595fc1e.mp3", "Nam can swim, but he can't play the guitar.": "audio/cau/7d46b51b1e362522.mp3", "A friend of yours cannot get a good night's sleep.": "audio/cau/44dd417be1715182.mp3", "I cannot hear you. It's too noisy.": "audio/cau/c25f8e78a3e62ab2.mp3", "My dad goes to work by car.": "audio/cau/9da1d69f2607f513.mp3", "There are more cars in the city than in the village.": "audio/cau/cff85749cb66c62f.mp3", "They carried out a study about city life.": "audio/cau/741e882cd91f0aed.mp3", "The old buses carried many passengers.": "audio/cau/1d29e18f669abb89.mp3", "Put the cat in the carrier.": "audio/cau/0d2221276a0a0ac3.mp3", "The mail carrier comes every morning.": "audio/cau/fb9a3cbe383ebc8b.mp3", "Can you help me carry this box?": "audio/cau/a0f121aef5c03fe7.mp3", "Lan carried her books, and today she carries her bag.": "audio/cau/e736c67580379245.mp3", "There are too many cars on the road.": "audio/cau/af9e36fc967bfae5.mp3", "This car is new, but those cars are old.": "audio/cau/a9c38aadea83ed91.mp3", "There are many changes in my hometown.": "audio/cau/5842dc08b691ba71.mp3", "Our town has made big changes, like new parks.": "audio/cau/d966270acb3214fd.mp3", "I often chat with my neighbours.": "audio/cau/f9bdc10e4250f241.mp3", "Mi and Lan had a long chat after school.": "audio/cau/92771962baaa6db3.mp3", "Mi checked her work, and the check took ten minutes.": "audio/cau/53e04ae5ad0ce9eb.mp3", "You have a choice of tea or juice.": "audio/cau/d83c640d99d55e18.mp3", "I think you made a good choice.": "audio/cau/89c0a3eddbcb6efd.mp3", "Nam is my new classmate.": "audio/cau/8f038868644223fc.mp3", "My classmate and I sit in the same classroom.": "audio/cau/ebc5ea3d6e23a8ba.mp3", "Minh is a clever boy.": "audio/cau/620f8c5f3017a282.mp3", "Lan is clever. She answers the questions cleverly.": "audio/cau/2720a9ae3428f690.mp3", "There is a clock on the wall.": "audio/cau/db00df18f8f94a24.mp3", "Nam has a watch, but his room has no clock.": "audio/cau/93f2ef3a8ab5efe7.mp3", "I came down with a cold last week.": "audio/cau/6589d8d2056f15e9.mp3", "It is cold in Ha Noi in winter.": "audio/cau/6af5e5587fe6cf7a.mp3", "I can feel the coldness of the water.": "audio/cau/23d48b220795c5bf.mp3", "Her coldness made him sad.": "audio/cau/681563c4a0ca6a61.mp3", "He has a big stamp collection.": "audio/cau/94e76b9f1458719c.mp3", "The museum has a collection of old pottery.": "audio/cau/e06badfc0761689a.mp3", "Please come to my birthday party.": "audio/cau/6800288294234b0b.mp3", "Nam came to school early yesterday.": "audio/cau/e4484967a289b802.mp3", "Success comes from hard work.": "audio/cau/104997cf355813ab.mp3", "Minh comes to school early, but yesterday he came late.": "audio/cau/8fc163a4c3b546e2.mp3", "My new friend is coming to my house.": "audio/cau/364032ec5fb1b2d1.mp3", "Lan came yesterday, and Hoa is coming today.": "audio/cau/2a3f62b0b9c0734e.mp3", "We communicate with friends by email.": "audio/cau/71c0cac04361b2eb.mp3", "Good communication helps us communicate better.": "audio/cau/83b537bc6eb88878.mp3", "Communication is important in a team.": "audio/cau/ceae7194d8982d8f.mp3", "We communicate in English to improve our communication skills.": "audio/cau/78dbdceb83728ae8.mp3", "She is a communicative student.": "audio/cau/c7fbc92e73c9d5a0.mp3", "Be communicative with your classmates.": "audio/cau/dde8f897fd3f06c4.mp3", "Complete the sentences with the words.": "audio/cau/a10abe8427f587a5.mp3", "Mi completed her homework. Now it is complete.": "audio/cau/e89d49e3a54806e8.mp3", "The old house is in bad condition.": "audio/cau/9d9ffa685f510da3.mp3", "You can go out on one condition.": "audio/cau/7b86edfe13e3aa0b.mp3", "Connect the laptop to the Internet.": "audio/cau/083f71db481310ee.mp3", "The bridge connects two villages.": "audio/cau/b1569f595ecaee4e.mp3", "Physical health is connected with your body.": "audio/cau/634a8a166182ee10.mp3", "Social media helps teens stay connected.": "audio/cau/47a2c362738b4ca7.mp3", "The Internet connection is slow.": "audio/cau/6daf4228c52c1d7e.mp3", "There is a connection between food and health.": "audio/cau/6f54a5cdaf66e2a7.mp3", "Use this button to control the robot.": "audio/cau/9f2b291e252e6265.mp3", "Try to control your anger.": "audio/cau/9d4301c7de9e612a.mp3", "Choose the correct answer A, B or C.": "audio/cau/6f45c31e9ee537be.mp3", "Nam's answer is correct, but mine is wrong.": "audio/cau/2f88ef38a2385ee5.mp3", "Cover your mouth when you sneeze.": "audio/cau/934dfc9e949736c3.mp3", "Snow covers the mountains.": "audio/cau/f26f2d71f0fe425d.mp3", "Lan creates a to-do list every Sunday evening.": "audio/cau/87a26e3235a8f368.mp3", "Our class created a poster about healthy living.": "audio/cau/97dc8c8a67b315e5.mp3", "Look at picture d and answer the question.": "audio/cau/cd1db823a64876e3.mp3", "Choose answer d, then write it in your notebook.": "audio/cau/d8924058670ef40e.mp3", "Traffic jams are part of daily life in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/c95ad670d219bd23.mp3", "Nam reads the news daily, every day before school.": "audio/cau/7ddb05aad387c96a.mp3", "It is dark outside now.": "audio/cau/48eaca11c1014cbe.mp3", "Minh's room is dark, so he turns on the light.": "audio/cau/8c6105f992faba73.mp3", "I have English every day.": "audio/cau/50a9802d88a8dbc0.mp3", "Nam studies by day and sleeps at night.": "audio/cau/0f498730d8ee8697.mp3", "There are seven days in a week.": "audio/cau/4193126d14e614a3.mp3", "I study English daily, even on busy days.": "audio/cau/f6f890f7b3bda2bf.mp3", "A smartphone is a useful device.": "audio/cau/eada35fd3db0ddb7.mp3", "Turn off all devices in class.": "audio/cau/4c08efedcbd5208a.mp3", "I did my homework last night.": "audio/cau/52c1dc6ad84a16a5.mp3", "Did you do the project? Yes, I did.": "audio/cau/ce2a17ba3a5d2ade.mp3", "Maths is difficult for me.": "audio/cau/16bb57fb47e5df02.mp3", "This test is difficult, but that one is easy.": "audio/cau/56b22511f0d64b7c.mp3", "My Internet is disconnected.": "audio/cau/c90d303019d1cef1.mp3", "The phone call was disconnected.": "audio/cau/c67e9b396ad9f544.mp3", "Let's discuss the problem in groups.": "audio/cau/cef13322a0d3b68b.mp3", "We discuss the plan, and the discussion takes ten minutes.": "audio/cau/a31966bdeac63e89.mp3", "We had a discussion about city life.": "audio/cau/d84c065603f75017.mp3", "After the discussion, we discussed it again with our teacher.": "audio/cau/054b4021e8aa37b4.mp3", "I dislike noisy and crowded places.": "audio/cau/5ace2bb2616bf75c.mp3", "Mi likes cats, but she dislikes dogs.": "audio/cau/a21ccd81f7c8d400.mp3", "The museum displays old coins.": "audio/cau/7ee8332be3e25460.mp3", "We displayed our drawings on the wall.": "audio/cau/72d8214dc0e8575b.mp3", "I do my homework after dinner.": "audio/cau/dfa2558950305f83.mp3", "Phong did his homework, and now it is done.": "audio/cau/4e496982963ec9df.mp3", "Does Lan like ice cream?": "audio/cau/15298c934c7dedf6.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but he doesn't watch TV.": "audio/cau/16100881d98fba74.mp3", "Mi doesn't like milk very much.": "audio/cau/63a58b0dc618ef2d.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but Minh doesn't do it.": "audio/cau/362bb11ca0696388.mp3", "What are you doing now?": "audio/cau/cc6dbef7715013a7.mp3", "Lan is doing her homework, and she did the maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/c6619d790ec63e61.mp3", "I have done my homework.": "audio/cau/319d28fa8d112271.mp3", "Nam did the test well; he has done a great job.": "audio/cau/a6f61635ce93b0e4.mp3", "Please sit down on the chair.": "audio/cau/08cb6a07df1ed303.mp3", "The cat jumps up and then comes down.": "audio/cau/009acd9ad7b1a705.mp3", "Lan's drawing is on the wall.": "audio/cau/e1c99913c9bb1dcf.mp3", "Minh draws well. He drew this drawing yesterday.": "audio/cau/a06a821e60587e14.mp3", "Do exercise e on page ten.": "audio/cau/f397a6a2157f10ba.mp3", "The word 'eye' starts with the letter e.": "audio/cau/5f2132c30b4b4b2f.mp3", "She answered the questions with ease.": "audio/cau/1ed3583b60bd53b0.mp3", "I feel at ease with my friends.": "audio/cau/fec10720b6d9bead.mp3", "Mi makes friends easily at school.": "audio/cau/eedb13c811943ed4.mp3", "The test was easy, so I finished it easily.": "audio/cau/7cb7e2c3342cf293.mp3", "This English exercise is very easy.": "audio/cau/708befc5d340e6e4.mp3", "This question is easy, but that one is difficult.": "audio/cau/6ec1dbc0277d41ef.mp3", "Students use electronic dictionaries.": "audio/cau/c1fbdb9a3ad5439b.mp3", "Too many electronic devices are bad for kids.": "audio/cau/2e57798310313754.mp3", "The ao dai looks very elegant.": "audio/cau/bdaf3e484235cf4d.mp3", "She is an elegant lady.": "audio/cau/018405f36d041fcb.mp3", "I write an email to my friend.": "audio/cau/8064d18c7a033e0f.mp3", "Lan emails me, and I read her email after school.": "audio/cau/b047656f3b7ce202.mp3", "Mi sends emails to her pen friend.": "audio/cau/82519ab81570dbfe.mp3", "I got two emails today, and one email is from Hoa.": "audio/cau/d803affddf31614d.mp3", "At the end of the story, he became a hero.": "audio/cau/4cef74a2fd4fb11a.mp3", "We read to the end, and the ending was happy.": "audio/cau/fc827bfa0e26aa94.mp3", "I enjoy living in the city.": "audio/cau/1cc10e53aebeec12.mp3", "We enjoy the trip because it is very enjoyable.": "audio/cau/1a682a8a24ff63b3.mp3", "The clown entertained the children.": "audio/cau/f769feda914ea794.mp3", "Music can entertain people of all ages.": "audio/cau/f5204e9c4d91bbb9.mp3", "The game show is very entertaining.": "audio/cau/0a77eddbcf1dbdaa.mp3", "He told us an entertaining story.": "audio/cau/28ed28e19b8b89ae.mp3", "Cities offer lots of entertainment.": "audio/cau/63cf66848c4eb0b8.mp3", "The show entertains children, so it is good entertainment.": "audio/cau/2e7c63c4052fabc6.mp3", "He even worked at night to help his family.": "audio/cau/35c426a9236c1cc0.mp3", "It is cold here, even in summer.": "audio/cau/65983b86a05b922c.mp3", "I do my homework in the evening.": "audio/cau/4615eb9cc8fbce85.mp3", "Good evening! We have dinner every evening at seven.": "audio/cau/737b0c650458cf41.mp3", "Cooking is an everyday activity for my mum.": "audio/cau/03801a514b91f476.mp3", "We use everyday English every day at school.": "audio/cau/61f0eab70fe5dd6e.mp3", "There are motorbikes everywhere in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/ece8d324941dccd0.mp3", "Mi looked everywhere, but her pen was nowhere.": "audio/cau/f836c2f6cfe51d90.mp3", "She excels at maths.": "audio/cau/189cef5080b7a458.mp3", "He excels in sports.": "audio/cau/28d9649e2db915c6.mp3", "Our school is known for excellence in teaching.": "audio/cau/bd51c7b26703ffd9.mp3", "She got an award for excellence.": "audio/cau/e102f2ac0cb5c3d0.mp3", "Hoa is excellent at managing her time.": "audio/cau/de820656572c573c.mp3", "Minh got an excellent mark in the English test.": "audio/cau/68dcd9cc4329d16b.mp3", "The team played excellently.": "audio/cau/f46f094c071d44fe.mp3", "She sang the song excellently.": "audio/cau/5aead8608ae5d92b.mp3", "I go to extra classes on Saturday.": "audio/cau/9f74582944a985cb.mp3", "Bring an extra pen to the exam.": "audio/cau/e6141c8a48c14beb.mp3", "Write T for true or F for false.": "audio/cau/d086c486993b428b.mp3", "Sentence 2 is false, so Nam writes F.": "audio/cau/87a27d221b2ce0ec.mp3", "Is this sentence true or false?": "audio/cau/b08a12186b6dfb5e.mp3", "That answer is false, but Hoa's answer is true.": "audio/cau/493842939182df2a.mp3", "Many families live in flats in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/0f99802cf5d0ebaf.mp3", "Families get together at Tet.": "audio/cau/60357c1a8fa848a4.mp3", "There are four people in my family.": "audio/cau/8324f70f7fed9e74.mp3", "Many families in my village grow rice.": "audio/cau/5b179b43939643fc.mp3", "We had a fantastic holiday.": "audio/cau/f32cf4ee7488001e.mp3", "The view from the top is fantastic.": "audio/cau/e447250983ededde.mp3", "She always wears fashionable clothes.": "audio/cau/224deed31a6b7076.mp3", "This hairstyle is very fashionable now.": "audio/cau/a5da03bcff324a2f.mp3", "City life is fast and busy.": "audio/cau/19460b2172566c3b.mp3", "Minh runs fast, but Nam runs faster.": "audio/cau/5811391018cae65d.mp3", "My favourite room is the kitchen.": "audio/cau/7fe9b9a43268f379.mp3", "Football is Nam's favourite sport.": "audio/cau/5418f30ef37044b0.mp3", "Touch the screen with your fingertips.": "audio/cau/8791bbf3582259e5.mp3", "With the Internet, information is at our fingertips.": "audio/cau/89f6b56ba0946260.mp3", "I finish my homework before dinner.": "audio/cau/4c12023029931700.mp3", "Hoa started the project in May and finished it in June.": "audio/cau/92423d5fe3d5c777.mp3", "Use the past simple for finished events.": "audio/cau/15e768d53722862d.mp3", "We finished our visual story yesterday.": "audio/cau/da44bbf9abdec66f.mp3", "In my future city, people live in smart flats.": "audio/cau/2647fcaf50d15541.mp3", "My aunt lives in a flat in a block of flats.": "audio/cau/edb1d75dbb47094e.mp3", "Follow the steps to make your poster.": "audio/cau/6579733e7f4abc4a.mp3", "Minh followed his teacher's advice and passed the exam.": "audio/cau/9fff6306c664e2d9.mp3", "Answer the following questions.": "audio/cau/7a648aa7c194b903.mp3", "We followed the plan the following day.": "audio/cau/f2e1b58551411942.mp3", "My parents forbid me to play games late.": "audio/cau/72d610837a7a8a7c.mp3", "The rules forbid smoking here.": "audio/cau/0aaa8f0d2b90ad71.mp3", "What do you do in your free time?": "audio/cau/561d82e572a21e67.mp3", "I am busy today, but I am free tomorrow.": "audio/cau/ed0144aa5c166e1b.mp3", "Nothing is more precious than independence and freedom.": "audio/cau/c78680a19317fb70.mp3", "Teenagers want more freedom.": "audio/cau/e07eefd97e88854b.mp3", "Animals move freely in the national park.": "audio/cau/25e7ba19bac40728.mp3", "You can speak freely here.": "audio/cau/7323942bb0641fc5.mp3", "Lan is my good friend.": "audio/cau/dd872f787d0777d3.mp3", "My friend Minh is very friendly.": "audio/cau/4f7040d4f93a465f.mp3", "Our new teacher is very friendly.": "audio/cau/0062f01a22f8a341.mp3", "Nam is friendly and has many friends.": "audio/cau/1865a7313d83db0c.mp3", "Mi and Lan are good friends.": "audio/cau/4315a79df8d3aac1.mp3", "Nam is friendly, so he makes friends easily.": "audio/cau/50b0e863c6e406f4.mp3", "Our friendship is very important to me.": "audio/cau/01f0404c79a2081f.mp3", "Lan and Hoa are close friends; their friendship is strong.": "audio/cau/9389591d845cf52e.mp3", "We have fun at the summer camp.": "audio/cau/042795d03f276893.mp3", "The game was fun, and Nam's jokes were funny.": "audio/cau/1343a6a406625409.mp3", "The word 'garden' starts with the letter G.": "audio/cau/855344adad6266b6.mp3", "Please write a capital G on the board.": "audio/cau/090b2d929a80461a.mp3", "We play a game in our English class.": "audio/cau/f89d92956bddd8c5.mp3", "My brother is a gamer, and he loves this game.": "audio/cau/5869b678fdd00fcc.mp3", "We play games at break time.": "audio/cau/d7be6e5b8ac32945.mp3", "Nam likes computer games, but his favourite game is chess.": "audio/cau/7f58cb7638af0917.mp3", "My friend gave me a book for my birthday.": "audio/cau/301ff487a1615458.mp3", "Lan gives gifts to friends; last year she gave me a pen.": "audio/cau/759dbf022fa0c89a.mp3", "Please give me your notebook.": "audio/cau/63fd3e27b3248933.mp3", "Hoa gives her mum flowers; yesterday she gave her a card.": "audio/cau/8a999a2635280ba0.mp3", "Lan finishes her project within the given time.": "audio/cau/e0a4a7e575000b77.mp3", "Our teacher has given us three tasks this week.": "audio/cau/cd0bbafcb1fa540b.mp3", "The horse has glossy black hair.": "audio/cau/688db3efbe05aabe.mp3", "I like glossy magazines.": "audio/cau/0502bba00a216ce1.mp3", "I go to school by bike.": "audio/cau/df5dcef1ab40916f.mp3", "We often go to the beach; last summer we went to Nha Trang.": "audio/cau/9dac5f396b6a209e.mp3", "My goal is to cycle five kilometres a day.": "audio/cau/e3304ad7b4c8f035.mp3", "Lan set a goal of reading one book a month.": "audio/cau/ee4448e244e28ea6.mp3", "Mum has gone to the market.": "audio/cau/85901dafd6c6e677.mp3", "The rain has gone.": "audio/cau/42856535a7f42416.mp3", "Nam is good at maths.": "audio/cau/4fd3587c745c05a2.mp3", "Lan's English is good, but Mi's is better.": "audio/cau/d371c25a8502dc92.mp3", "That's a great idea for our project!": "audio/cau/a54aafc7aa505f92.mp3", "We had a great time; the trip was wonderful.": "audio/cau/3dc3e9c44a5960ce.mp3", "Your help is greatly appreciated.": "audio/cau/3e7c4dbae7d688f3.mp3", "Technology has greatly changed our lives.": "audio/cau/718fe374663a2930.mp3", "Each group has four members.": "audio/cau/6db9bb96270db26c.mp3", "Work in groups and report your group's findings.": "audio/cau/dd390edb36c261a2.mp3", "The teacher puts us into groups of five.": "audio/cau/ec8808da410c34e5.mp3", "Our class has six groups, and each group has six students.": "audio/cau/0f693c5a4478ab4f.mp3", "David works out at his home gym.": "audio/cau/56b62fa69d74bb24.mp3", "My father goes to the gym three times a week.": "audio/cau/87f096de0334b154.mp3", "We had a great time at the camp.": "audio/cau/9119cf6bce83ae88.mp3", "I have breakfast at six, but yesterday I had it late.": "audio/cau/8a0bd1bf7d672961.mp3", "The maths test was very hard.": "audio/cau/0fd61471858155e3.mp3", "Minh works hard; he is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/32c549e4a9f6fc13.mp3", "Lan has two brothers.": "audio/cau/3ee04272e80b66c1.mp3", "Nam has a new bike; he had an old one before.": "audio/cau/756f69898700b7f4.mp3", "I hate waiting for the bus in the rain.": "audio/cau/3f99a8ce5b4ab56c.mp3", "Nam likes city life, but he hates traffic jams.": "audio/cau/6300158d6a0d3117.mp3", "I have a cat and a dog.": "audio/cau/3942c510ddf250d4.mp3", "We have English today, and we had Maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/f53b658e1d0dc09e.mp3", "We are having lunch in the canteen.": "audio/cau/68be2432f9d1c150.mp3", "Lan is having fun because she has many friends here.": "audio/cau/955a8fc5bad8bd17.mp3", "My height is one metre fifty.": "audio/cau/6ed0620c69bbaf2a.mp3", "The tower is very high; its height is 100 metres.": "audio/cau/3baba19856abae04.mp3", "The campaign heightens awareness of pollution.": "audio/cau/56be7ae049bd5030.mp3", "Music can heighten your mood.": "audio/cau/6b33e5d565f0fa6e.mp3", "Can you help me with my homework?": "audio/cau/59064ec1f34486d3.mp3", "Mi is helpful; she always helps her mum cook.": "audio/cau/82b6e08d58022ab1.mp3", "A street cleaner is a community helper.": "audio/cau/4e5627311f32688c.mp3", "The helper always helps old people cross the road.": "audio/cau/5d453af4870fad09.mp3", "The map is very helpful for tourists.": "audio/cau/01dfa6b6d0d2dc96.mp3", "Mi is helpful; she often helps her neighbours.": "audio/cau/28366edc55c3b71c.mp3", "Nam helps his father in the garden.": "audio/cau/872717d07d581517.mp3", "Lan is helpful, and she likes to help her friends.": "audio/cau/1681abe8d625bbeb.mp3", "The sky train runs high above the ground.": "audio/cau/8dbedccf6d7409b7.mp3", "Birds fly high in the sky.": "audio/cau/b0c96ceb3c271f43.mp3", "Highlight the new words in yellow.": "audio/cau/d498bca60b2480af.mp3", "The highlight of the trip was the cave.": "audio/cau/70cc00f7daf64e62.mp3", "Match each highlighted word with its definition.": "audio/cau/2054b6647f7ccadc.mp3", "Lan highlighted the new words with a yellow highlighter.": "audio/cau/ecd4a9023406bc13.mp3", "I use a pink highlighter for key words.": "audio/cau/a9c241d4fed9b266.mp3", "Can I borrow your highlighter?": "audio/cau/dc25525dc68ae2af.mp3", "This book is highly interesting.": "audio/cau/009ba70280cc0bc3.mp3", "I highly recommend this film.": "audio/cau/da2440ac003a9db6.mp3", "He hits the ball very hard.": "audio/cau/d7c0d8123db135ef.mp3", "This singer has many hits.": "audio/cau/8dfe55b887da248c.mp3", "Please hold my bag for a moment.": "audio/cau/c556d9592e549b94.mp3", "Our school holds a sports day every year.": "audio/cau/290d899c332b44e8.mp3", "I go home at five o'clock.": "audio/cau/a74ab800c921a80b.mp3", "After school, Mi does her homework at home.": "audio/cau/ecaf6456acc0b85d.mp3", "Nam does his homework at home every evening.": "audio/cau/0c529025b7e7c4aa.mp3", "I do my homework for an hour every evening.": "audio/cau/ada27edeb21f8fa6.mp3", "The bus comes hourly, so we wait an hour.": "audio/cau/3f37385bc8e75b24.mp3", "The bus leaves hourly.": "audio/cau/b60d74f653d3238e.mp3", "There is an hourly news update.": "audio/cau/f0d01c74c30ee817.mp3", "I sleep eight hours every night.": "audio/cau/4350cf565a1eec6c.mp3", "It takes one hour by bus and two hours by bike.": "audio/cau/8da5efa497de8fae.mp3", "Our house is near the river.": "audio/cau/462620c6e9d42610.mp3", "Lan's house is big, so the housework takes a long time.": "audio/cau/ffae3b516fc16794.mp3", "There are many old houses in Hoi An.": "audio/cau/34fd0f5f435c76b8.mp3", "My house is small, but the houses next to it are big.": "audio/cau/7b3c64660ff20ef8.mp3", "Lan helps her mother with the housework.": "audio/cau/603758dd29202743.mp3", "I do housework at weekends, like cleaning the house.": "audio/cau/603861c40de6e77e.mp3", "How did he become a famous doctor?": "audio/cau/0acfb865542d1705.mp3", "How old is Minh, and how does he go to school?": "audio/cau/0d6be1faa0d18a2b.mp3", "He was poor. However, he never gave up.": "audio/cau/893555bad2aff789.mp3", "It rained. However, Nam still went to school, but late.": "audio/cau/97115d20f691f7e4.mp3", "Call the doctor immediately!": "audio/cau/3af61681df60c831.mp3", "She answered immediately.": "audio/cau/d719228c3aee39c8.mp3", "We talked about the importance of local crafts.": "audio/cau/1dd1fbbbd5db7ba1.mp3", "Sleep is important; we all know its importance.": "audio/cau/39fdef6a24182eb1.mp3", "It is important to keep our streets clean.": "audio/cau/4541b30fbeb1b8aa.mp3", "Reading is important; never forget its importance.": "audio/cau/0b2b91b8a69bb8c9.mp3", "More importantly, we must save water.": "audio/cau/09a367b8deac295f.mp3", "Most importantly, be kind to others.": "audio/cau/8709c00d7d3b3af1.mp3", "Please inform your parents about the trip.": "audio/cau/13aeeaab5b16b406.mp3", "The radio informs us about the weather.": "audio/cau/11a03146fba546fa.mp3", "Read the information about the summer camp.": "audio/cau/79656cd9cf078d89.mp3", "Our teacher informs us and gives us useful information.": "audio/cau/91b87a5117185e7b.mp3", "This TV programme is very informative.": "audio/cau/8bc42a012462e39b.mp3", "The museum guide was informative.": "audio/cau/3690ade728312b48.mp3", "After 'How about', we use the verb with -ing.": "audio/cau/0b5b2f5d668491cd.mp3", "How about buying a new lamp for your bedroom?": "audio/cau/55a020c7bbf1ac54.mp3", "Dolphins are intelligent animals.": "audio/cau/ff347eccc7ca9ffd.mp3", "She is an intelligent student.": "audio/cau/3510c8cda7bcca9d.mp3", "My school is big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/d5765e25cafa0eea.mp3", "Today it is sunny, but yesterday it was rainy.": "audio/cau/ed1bcaf6501bfd0c.mp3", "Minh finished his project just before the due date.": "audio/cau/6a8c8ece8bd3699e.mp3", "Hoa arrived just before the test started.": "audio/cau/ddc502e35be5489a.mp3", "The word 'kitchen' starts with the letter k.": "audio/cau/ac85fdd0f3c32f82.mp3", "Please write a capital K on the board.": "audio/cau/f5d61da2bd65aeef.mp3", "We should keep our streets clean.": "audio/cau/3f2dd8440f55f148.mp3", "Lan kept her old toys, and she still keeps them.": "audio/cau/d20c525ce8b90756.mp3", "The zoo keeper feeds the animals.": "audio/cau/06704e78accc1c51.mp3", "Our keeper saved the ball.": "audio/cau/af8db4e0f0173737.mp3", "Do you know his life story?": "audio/cau/db0ea43493818ad0.mp3", "I know her well; I knew her at primary school.": "audio/cau/26baffaf9e8a0ddb.mp3", "Reading books gives us knowledge.": "audio/cau/3868a26411c64bc8.mp3", "He has a good knowledge of history.": "audio/cau/82ba68ba3a00f28e.mp3", "Uncle Ho is known and loved by all Vietnamese people.": "audio/cau/e714527fbec233eb.mp3", "Many people know him; he is well known in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/ea446edd847c7b43.mp3", "The word 'lamp' starts with the letter l.": "audio/cau/c5e08a5413a4f66b.mp3", "Please write a capital L on the board.": "audio/cau/63173cda63a08912.mp3", "There is a lamp on my desk.": "audio/cau/80d55c1669ed8758.mp3", "Turn on the lamp; the light is too weak.": "audio/cau/19093375e9e548a3.mp3", "I do my homework on my laptop.": "audio/cau/589d1a653bc52a30.mp3", "Her laptop is very light.": "audio/cau/bc29cc2cf583a3f7.mp3", "My house has a large garden.": "audio/cau/aca5eaaef305eea5.mp3", "Their house is large, and their garden is very big.": "audio/cau/58f11bb60767bcfb.mp3", "Make a leaflet about saving energy.": "audio/cau/190e449672ddc5e9.mp3", "She gave me a leaflet about the festival.": "audio/cau/9d3486cd9c825e34.mp3", "We handed out leaflets in the street.": "audio/cau/e1e72d61997cba74.mp3", "The leaflets tell people to save water.": "audio/cau/ee5db2532169385c.mp3", "Students need to sleep at least eight hours a day.": "audio/cau/06d7a5fd2aadd1a8.mp3", "Nam has less homework than Mi, and Lan has the least.": "audio/cau/144df5d8b5b5a253.mp3", "He had to leave school at the age of fifteen.": "audio/cau/0036ab8cf9a331c5.mp3", "We leave home at six; yesterday we left at seven.": "audio/cau/d3d9e5743a9b9bd0.mp3", "What does Chau say before she leaves?": "audio/cau/b30bd63d9ace5d55.mp3", "They wrap com in two layers of leaves.": "audio/cau/7f5122adae1f0f18.mp3", "Describe your hair by its length and colour.": "audio/cau/ad23f44edd907020.mp3", "The length of the table is two metres; it's long.": "audio/cau/84f01bf78c674bd1.mp3", "Let me help you with your bags.": "audio/cau/41dd52ad0f012862.mp3", "Mum let me go out yesterday; she lets me go on Sundays.": "audio/cau/46fc2d4c33221e5d.mp3", "Stop when the traffic light is red.": "audio/cau/dd4921089bcbaa08.mp3", "Turn on the light, please; the room is dark.": "audio/cau/dd20920a13027c13.mp3", "I like noodles very much.": "audio/cau/7557928354c11c4a.mp3", "I like cats, but I dislike spiders.": "audio/cau/bdd9c25c87fbc823.mp3", "Minh likes playing football.": "audio/cau/8b21f729dbeb8632.mp3", "Hoa likes music, but I like art.": "audio/cau/e9144dc6f8053afb.mp3", "Please listen to Lan's life story carefully.": "audio/cau/5e66ffcca03d62ba.mp3", "Minh is a good listener; he always listens to his friends.": "audio/cau/2a4b1d64993cd32a.mp3", "My mum is a good listener.": "audio/cau/c361fe2d103db23c.mp3", "The radio programme has many listeners.": "audio/cau/95723f87c574336f.mp3", "Thank you for listening.": "audio/cau/ee26d140bc752b99.mp3", "Nam is listening to music; he loves to listen to pop songs.": "audio/cau/8451afe66a0bd788.mp3", "My little brother is five years old.": "audio/cau/e22af4e6bb3d77f0.mp3", "I have a little money, but my sister has less.": "audio/cau/520fdc680c743ed9.mp3", "The Mekong is a very long river.": "audio/cau/962b2d2abaecb121.mp3", "Mi has long hair, but Lan has short hair.": "audio/cau/21e34cbfd1358b0e.mp3", "Look at the board, please.": "audio/cau/512572a71fea8cfe.mp3", "Look at Minh! He is very good-looking today.": "audio/cau/3a8f3a88e8a3813b.mp3", "Mi is looking for her notebook in the bedroom.": "audio/cau/9cf0853b1a840504.mp3", "Look! Nam is looking at the picture on the wall.": "audio/cau/debf12a72a75e3eb.mp3", "Mi looks happy today.": "audio/cau/d53ae1b2afc27fcb.mp3", "Look at Nam; he looks tired.": "audio/cau/b6b16cdb7526bf98.mp3", "Mai has a lot of friends at school.": "audio/cau/5010f52a3a68ba0b.mp3", "Minh reads a lot, and he has lots of books.": "audio/cau/356256a0d64c06ca.mp3", "There are lots of books in our school library.": "audio/cau/3190c7d803a13870.mp3", "Phong has lots of friends and a lot of free time.": "audio/cau/4a66fae37e042e36.mp3", "I love my family.": "audio/cau/02c5061798cc56cc.mp3", "My grandma is loving, and I love her a lot.": "audio/cau/588e4f5967e2076b.mp3", "The price of this book is low.": "audio/cau/0a550bb977c74722.mp3", "The wall is very low.": "audio/cau/e9866ca6574d7e65.mp3", "I'm a student at Nguyen Du High School.": "audio/cau/fc4e40becc452649.mp3", "I'm happy because I am with my best friends.": "audio/cau/70dc61c954d001ef.mp3", "He made his first computer in a small garage.": "audio/cau/ab57132318aeca10.mp3", "This vase is made of clay; people make it in Bat Trang.": "audio/cau/e23523961a9ed154.mp3", "Hard work can make your dreams come true.": "audio/cau/b31d6220b696ab85.mp3", "He made many mistakes, but he learnt to make good choices.": "audio/cau/f95abe45aba09ae8.mp3", "He is a famous film maker.": "audio/cau/68e4b5c408bfa483.mp3", "My uncle is a furniture maker.": "audio/cau/177cfe96f7f1bf13.mp3", "Mai is making a birthday card for Lan.": "audio/cau/dc70bb88704df4a4.mp3", "We are making paper flowers; we made ten yesterday.": "audio/cau/2de37c2668104819.mp3", "Hoa uses red to mark exam days on her calendar.": "audio/cau/78135abe90fe0ad6.mp3", "Nam marks his due dates with a yellow pen.": "audio/cau/9321f43accfdd88b.mp3", "Match the words with the pictures.": "audio/cau/c554f0656d3ab896.mp3", "Match the names with the photos and connect them with lines.": "audio/cau/b9cb7dc9f6dfba6f.mp3", "Bamboo is the main material for these baskets.": "audio/cau/ef5ba6194efe554b.mp3", "Clay is a local material, and potters use many materials.": "audio/cau/ca5f418251e27953.mp3", "What does 'craft village' mean?": "audio/cau/4c5a16ea9baf9474.mp3", "What do these words mean? Let's check their meaning.": "audio/cau/2a235e867bbba30d.mp3", "Look up the meaning of new words in a dictionary.": "audio/cau/d2030b4713d39b26.mp3", "This gift has a special meaning, so it is meaningful to me.": "audio/cau/d0dcab7ed3224224.mp3", "Helping old people is a meaningful activity.": "audio/cau/d7f05d5006077d20.mp3", "She gave me a meaningful gift.": "audio/cau/846ca5d5159fa816.mp3", "Some English words have two meanings.": "audio/cau/c6e4715d74edc5b6.mp3", "One word can have many meanings, so check what it means here.": "audio/cau/6b80e6c4dbc628c3.mp3", "Mai sends me a message every evening.": "audio/cau/a9c6b25a2357a625.mp3", "Can I leave a message for Mr Minh?": "audio/cau/5ea5e2442839d4cb.mp3", "I chat with my friends on Messenger.": "audio/cau/e7524dcb65b59059.mp3", "The messenger brought a letter.": "audio/cau/73a3333eb8f61f02.mp3", "This is a good method to learn words.": "audio/cau/3c706623138a9ce2.mp3", "Our teacher uses a new method.": "audio/cau/63fd83da91e3b54f.mp3", "We had a mini test today.": "audio/cau/4d139fd629df1a52.mp3", "She bought a mini fan.": "audio/cau/314e486585bd5517.mp3", "Winning the prize was the best moment of her life.": "audio/cau/b23567e36b8caafb.mp3", "At the moment, she is busy, so wait a moment.": "audio/cau/c8389c89ec495ec4.mp3", "There was a momentary silence.": "audio/cau/1b2ce9dd8a6c703b.mp3", "It was only a momentary problem.": "audio/cau/2310ea2ca53aea69.mp3", "She saved money to buy a new bike.": "audio/cau/47b199504b22fee6.mp3", "Don't waste money; save some money every month.": "audio/cau/6545086d5613a2d1.mp3", "The flat is big. Moreover, it is cheap.": "audio/cau/c5fbb0c1b6482deb.mp3", "Cycling is fun. Moreover, it is healthy.": "audio/cau/a33407044953c815.mp3", "I get up at six every morning.": "audio/cau/838c5da1aad62be2.mp3", "We study in the morning and play in the evening.": "audio/cau/8a176d8289d946ce.mp3", "The people in my neighbourhood are mostly friendly.": "audio/cau/54584631f0893d3f.mp3", "We mostly travel by bus because it is cheap.": "audio/cau/05f1e9640ad3b61c.mp3", "I listen to music every evening.": "audio/cau/947b04b66aabe669.mp3", "Phong loves music, and he wants to be a musician.": "audio/cau/2a338296f019ee09.mp3", "Can you play a musical instrument?": "audio/cau/4b45a019b7f1df1c.mp3", "She comes from a musical family.": "audio/cau/da92e12306feca96.mp3", "Trinh Cong Son is a famous musician.": "audio/cau/44ebea42904bff46.mp3", "She wants to be a musician.": "audio/cau/a69499a50cc7cc48.mp3", "In 'running', we double the letter n.": "audio/cau/f2d3227ba2e63feb.mp3", "Run ends in n, so we write running with two n's.": "audio/cau/840a0ecac7ac2b05.mp3", "It's nearly six o'clock, so let's go home.": "audio/cau/245ae82d42650c9f.mp3", "Nam nearly missed the bus; he was almost late.": "audio/cau/b606a8d1edcf35c6.mp3", "Is it necessary to wear a helmet?": "audio/cau/310488fddb9b7077.mp3", "Water is necessary for life; it is a basic necessity.": "audio/cau/1c5a7a36e7e8db29.mp3", "We need more parks in the city.": "audio/cau/fa790aed3aa20742.mp3", "Plants need water, and Mi needs some help.": "audio/cau/43af483482c3e17f.mp3", "The village needs a new bridge.": "audio/cau/1beac53452ba3355.mp3", "Nam needs a pen, and I need one too.": "audio/cau/bd84b90357a9da88.mp3", "Social networking is popular with teens.": "audio/cau/5713225cc2e405e8.mp3", "Networking helps you find a job.": "audio/cau/24e76e41dbcd5b02.mp3", "She never gave up her dream.": "audio/cau/b95a5dea82e7f24d.mp3", "Never give up; always try your best.": "audio/cau/45044467beb1d1bf.mp3", "See you next week!": "audio/cau/e955abbc627cb84b.mp3", "Last week we had a test, and next week we have a trip.": "audio/cau/e51bba1694cc9fe2.mp3", "The city is noisy at night.": "audio/cau/003950b6dbcd9d77.mp3", "We went out last night, so tonight we stay at home.": "audio/cau/334224d67553dca2.mp3", "It's a normal school day.": "audio/cau/08fb09ec5f3aa8ba.mp3", "Is it normal to feel tired?": "audio/cau/047d3b410e06cbb9.mp3", "She did not give up her dream.": "audio/cau/b5d39e3052bc5fbb.mp3", "I am not tired, and I'm not hungry.": "audio/cau/9485504d93b05a38.mp3", "Make a note of the new words.": "audio/cau/8bdaf02876855cac.mp3", "I write a short note in my notebook.": "audio/cau/3b565057bfcdee58.mp3", "I write new words in my notebook.": "audio/cau/54f4386b8856f178.mp3", "Mi's notebook is full of short notes.": "audio/cau/684bf34705fb9a6b.mp3", "Take notes while you listen.": "audio/cau/a76ebe77aa288aab.mp3", "I write a short note and keep all my notes in a notebook.": "audio/cau/26f4f6be6ec1126c.mp3", "I got a notification from the app.": "audio/cau/1d895fb1459593d7.mp3", "Turn off the notification when you study.": "audio/cau/0bf240530c9c0b1b.mp3", "My phone shows too many notifications.": "audio/cau/ac2cb5ad472b3628.mp3", "I check my notifications after school.": "audio/cau/6f1c84c659aa4158.mp3", "I am doing my homework now.": "audio/cau/c512289bbb165978.mp3", "It is raining now, so we stay at home.": "audio/cau/ac1b5a1cae28deb6.mp3", "My key is nowhere to be found.": "audio/cau/92752143e22d93ad.mp3", "There is nowhere to park here.": "audio/cau/19e049e63eec2277.mp3", "Turn off the lights when you leave.": "audio/cau/3a68f3ab6e248006.mp3", "Turn on the fan, but turn off the TV.": "audio/cau/bdd957c99adde5f0.mp3", "I often get up at six o'clock.": "audio/cau/08008a46175a2d25.mp3", "Minh often reads books, but he never plays games.": "audio/cau/a29cadde346ad9ba.mp3", "There is only one bed in my bedroom.": "audio/cau/000e91b12face3a4.mp3", "Lan is an only child; she has just one cousin.": "audio/cau/b6ec9a93c21bdf30.mp3", "Taking the bus is a good option.": "audio/cau/0adef274ed4bc7c4.mp3", "The metro is the best option, and it's my first choice.": "audio/cau/e3ef81ffc2d39da2.mp3", "This lesson is optional.": "audio/cau/b526fef4235dc75a.mp3", "Art club is optional for students.": "audio/cau/d45f1b7eb287b1a6.mp3", "It was an ordinary day.": "audio/cau/52cbb46a0074cc8e.mp3", "He is an ordinary student.": "audio/cau/88fbbeb6c5eb9133.mp3", "Our school organised a book fair.": "audio/cau/b8e5335267df2055.mp3", "She is a very organised student.": "audio/cau/78dd6fbd6335576d.mp3", "Get enough sleep every night; otherwise, your health will suffer.": "audio/cau/88349a162c32012c.mp3", "Wear a coat; otherwise, you might catch a cold.": "audio/cau/58a979e859eb4708.mp3", "Mi went out with her friends last night.": "audio/cau/6662db3eac9ce4e0.mp3", "Nam wants to find out more about his grandfather's life.": "audio/cau/c2c4b3120ecb6468.mp3", "The city has many outdoor markets.": "audio/cau/70f031e665dcb6a3.mp3", "Phong likes outdoor sports, so he often plays outdoors.": "audio/cau/62d7cb3e1f835b37.mp3", "She is an outstanding student.": "audio/cau/114d138533e97e0b.mp3", "The team gave an outstanding performance.": "audio/cau/30f6882f94f7003e.mp3", "The film starts at 8 p.m.": "audio/cau/5b3d11f7cb5bec98.mp3", "School finishes at 4.30 p.m., and I have dinner at 7 p.m.": "audio/cau/6193e0ae396e4d78.mp3", "I need a new pair of shoes for school.": "audio/cau/250c1c4ccfb0d448.mp3", "Find a partner and work in pairs.": "audio/cau/9f9cc8d6f86e7886.mp3", "Work in pairs and ask each other questions.": "audio/cau/2bae203d74ef1339.mp3", "There are ten pairs, so each pair gets one card.": "audio/cau/6a0e4948c63a816b.mp3", "This part of the lesson is about friends.": "audio/cau/fe137d473624dc0c.mp3", "We take part in the game, and it is partly about music.": "audio/cau/f86fd833e90206a2.mp3", "Ask your partner about his favourite food.": "audio/cau/422fdd4d69934397.mp3", "Minh is my partner, and we work in pairs.": "audio/cau/c79cf650c67747ae.mp3", "Check your partner's answers.": "audio/cau/8b9fe2fbda4495f1.mp3", "Write down your partner's ideas.": "audio/cau/30548b87b1dac25f.mp3", "Our school has a partnership with a school in Japan.": "audio/cau/94480f1a5b1a2bf9.mp3", "Good partnership makes good results.": "audio/cau/6f55e8eb690f4709.mp3", "Read the passage and answer the questions.": "audio/cau/9a3c0d57d2e7ee93.mp3", "This passage is about Tet.": "audio/cau/6d3bf3c7448a33f3.mp3", "There are five people in my family.": "audio/cau/61d24a117613907d.mp3", "One person is late, but the other people are here.": "audio/cau/b4e5b7ba18b09096.mp3", "Phones are not permitted in class.": "audio/cau/42d9175751787d56.mp3", "My parents permit me to go out on Sunday.": "audio/cau/1cf0ddcc2b64df94.mp3", "He is a kind and hard-working person.": "audio/cau/a7cc8ccdfee48d42.mp3", "One person came first, then many people came.": "audio/cau/e2f7a3bc001f7fc0.mp3", "This is my personal diary.": "audio/cau/4bb512632de09306.mp3", "Don't share personal information online.": "audio/cau/e4de8d484708e9e5.mp3", "I use my phone to call my grandparents.": "audio/cau/8e9996c8fa495f09.mp3", "Lan phoned me last night on her new phone.": "audio/cau/8ac9d116e44bf63f.mp3", "She phoned her mother every evening.": "audio/cau/349bb738f214ff06.mp3", "Nam phoned Minh, and Minh called him back.": "audio/cau/23c05f3d2997559f.mp3", "Can you take a photo of us?": "audio/cau/4e7337681afc841a.mp3", "This photo is a nice picture of my class.": "audio/cau/94f608c9dc656d2b.mp3", "This is a photograph of my family.": "audio/cau/be34afde07857706.mp3", "She took a photograph of the sea.": "audio/cau/0deaad3e91e725aa.mp3", "My uncle is a photographer.": "audio/cau/84945e0c05f98e38.mp3", "The photographer took many pictures.": "audio/cau/78c35f6d244bab0b.mp3", "We looked at old photographs.": "audio/cau/669f0332f867cd84.mp3", "He took photographs of the trip.": "audio/cau/16ffe46c3b10d0b1.mp3", "Look at the photos of my friends.": "audio/cau/8a988a56d17dddc5.mp3", "Mi takes a photo, and Lan takes many photos.": "audio/cau/df1811e9acc25b9a.mp3", "Look at the picture and describe the man.": "audio/cau/b1d73989f1f7619c.mp3", "Hoa draws a picture, and Nam takes a photo of it.": "audio/cau/40c2b9c3207a7713.mp3", "Mi draws beautiful pictures in art class.": "audio/cau/1037e2e30ff7fb85.mp3", "We took many photos and put the pictures on the wall.": "audio/cau/5ddc63bf192b9304.mp3", "Can I have a piece of paper?": "audio/cau/a721b0473c8251c5.mp3", "Lan cuts the cake into eight pieces.": "audio/cau/8d015d96c4090b95.mp3", "Here are some pieces of advice for teens.": "audio/cau/31c475374fcd7ee5.mp3", "Eat a piece of fruit, not three pieces of cake.": "audio/cau/011558a866e5d41a.mp3", "We need a plan for our project.": "audio/cau/e33a8fe9fb341903.mp3", "Nam planned his trip carefully with his family.": "audio/cau/f61c169a10484b3b.mp3", "Nam and Phong play football after school.": "audio/cau/4f990530a36010eb.mp3", "The children play in the playground at break time.": "audio/cau/01c38c5563b4ece0.mp3", "He is a good football player.": "audio/cau/2592e456810d1a0e.mp3", "Each player has three cards.": "audio/cau/2733b581f437ad82.mp3", "My puppy is very playful.": "audio/cau/2a941a50bd420b1b.mp3", "She has a playful smile.": "audio/cau/f0b4790d33181781.mp3", "The children play football in the playground.": "audio/cau/ba97d8ec376ab1f4.mp3", "Lan and Hoa play games in the school playground.": "audio/cau/16841dfb20eb6b7d.mp3", "He was born into a poor family.": "audio/cau/f960f9dc0b1abeb6.mp3", "She helped poor children and fought against poverty.": "audio/cau/f7b2c8475fadd81a.mp3", "I have a portable speaker.": "audio/cau/7f204975d53ca68a.mp3", "This computer is light and portable.": "audio/cau/6ceac939567b6db9.mp3", "She painted a portrait of her mother.": "audio/cau/f4c1cb855753a906.mp3", "There is a portrait on the wall.": "audio/cau/2c3d7700351361fc.mp3", "Wash your hands to prevent illness.": "audio/cau/b69bb0c14f593fd9.mp3", "Trees prevent floods.": "audio/cau/3fa04812a37075b6.mp3", "Look at the previous page.": "audio/cau/5236de3455b3c630.mp3", "I met her the previous day.": "audio/cau/209d74f5321dec53.mp3", "My sister goes to primary school.": "audio/cau/fe85d52dd9f529f5.mp3", "Rice is the primary food in Vietnam.": "audio/cau/25a669b67e6752bc.mp3", "Everyone needs some privacy.": "audio/cau/29d76fa6b9e44583.mp3", "Protect your privacy online.": "audio/cau/571da71f00d67764.mp3", "Which internet provider do you use?": "audio/cau/f9b72e33887e811f.mp3", "She is the main provider for her family.": "audio/cau/af87522c8ed30119.mp3", "Pull the door to open it.": "audio/cau/9309601c0672fc19.mp3", "The horse pulls the cart.": "audio/cau/87242600c3f741dc.mp3", "There are 40 pupils in my class.": "audio/cau/fa147b5c3216f8cc.mp3", "She is a good pupil.": "audio/cau/e17bb8917e55a7f5.mp3", "What is the purpose of this building?": "audio/cau/c0a9c9321aa3a396.mp3", "Our aim is to help people, and that is our purpose.": "audio/cau/5c1e912b871737c5.mp3", "She leads a purposeful life.": "audio/cau/61c62af9856410ea.mp3", "Make your study time purposeful.": "audio/cau/1af3fbcb31dc8433.mp3", "These shoes are of high quality.": "audio/cau/4618ad6c7715b1e8.mp3", "The air quality is poor today.": "audio/cau/d796826ebffea45e.mp3", "Can I ask you a question, Ms Hoa?": "audio/cau/7e99e348210556f2.mp3", "Nam asks a question, and Mi gives the answer.": "audio/cau/269c53bfb0db8e6f.mp3", "Please fill in the questionnaire.": "audio/cau/a95121e3928b213d.mp3", "We did a questionnaire about hobbies.": "audio/cau/c390090db32f59d5.mp3", "The teacher asks us three questions.": "audio/cau/9e7c27a7a37e13a0.mp3", "Read the questions carefully and write your answers.": "audio/cau/7fcc03272c2a6124.mp3", "Let's have a quick look at the poster.": "audio/cau/74f69b26a440762a.mp3", "Nam is a quick learner, so he learns quickly.": "audio/cau/5e11bac22bdaf305.mp3", "She quickly became famous.": "audio/cau/69d2407f5c23a407.mp3", "Minh walks quickly, but his brother walks slowly.": "audio/cau/df1476232b08c52c.mp3", "The word 'red' starts with the letter r.": "audio/cau/19d12f34975f740f.mp3", "'Rabbit' and 'room' both begin with R.": "audio/cau/aca28cd4f322eeb4.mp3", "I rarely go to the cinema.": "audio/cau/665f28d3968d7eec.mp3", "Snow is rare in Ha Noi, so we rarely see it.": "audio/cau/651a9aa109c5d5ab.mp3", "I read a book before bed every night.": "audio/cau/52f4120305948c56.mp3", "Yesterday Mi read a story, because reading is her hobby.": "audio/cau/a206c7fecbd29a47.mp3", "My sister is a fast reader.": "audio/cau/c997b3414e90f2e3.mp3", "Lan is a good reader because she reads every day.": "audio/cau/804882ef0e352a60.mp3", "Reading helps us learn new words.": "audio/cau/a36b0142402545f6.mp3", "I read a story last night, and it was great.": "audio/cau/67941e0da7d7be3c.mp3", "Give one reason why you like your friend.": "audio/cau/a3f79369c8db7055.mp3", "The price is reasonable, and that is my reason for buying it.": "audio/cau/f927cd67a281473b.mp3", "The prices here are reasonable.": "audio/cau/ae60767c664ffa40.mp3", "That's a reasonable idea.": "audio/cau/a58450244623d611.mp3", "There are many reasons to make new friends.": "audio/cau/b4aec367cd011148.mp3", "Write two reasons, and explain each reason.": "audio/cau/0e00874bd41b6407.mp3", "Please remain in your seats.": "audio/cau/a69a901e69682f29.mp3", "The weather will remain hot.": "audio/cau/e5c6ac18b5424f3e.mp3", "I set a reminder on my phone.": "audio/cau/e8c14f2329d4fe5a.mp3", "This photo is a reminder of our trip.": "audio/cau/1450cb31d6e3f233.mp3", "Write reminders on sticky notes.": "audio/cau/9c0e08707367828c.mp3", "The app sends reminders.": "audio/cau/6e8a4a6499fb87f4.mp3", "How does Elena reply to her mum?": "audio/cau/dcaf59d7091175e8.mp3", "Please reply to my email soon.": "audio/cau/1fbb259adb0f0a8b.mp3", "Do some research about dinosaurs.": "audio/cau/d5eec01ebfc997ff.mp3", "Scientists do research in the lab.": "audio/cau/40bb2099db60c98c.mp3", "Your answer is right, Nam.": "audio/cau/de0207c9ebd60141.mp3", "Is this answer right or wrong?": "audio/cau/6f5632fc348cdcbc.mp3", "She rightly said no.": "audio/cau/0716d99ea752c0a9.mp3", "He was rightly proud of his work.": "audio/cau/82f83dc7701970f6.mp3", "Paint the wall with a roller.": "audio/cau/03c0261569ee7693.mp3", "I want to ride the roller coaster.": "audio/cau/06f0af80b29dc893.mp3", "She's my best friend in class 6A.": "audio/cau/810592fcf73e04e7.mp3", "This is Vinh's bike, and he's in my class.": "audio/cau/6a8b8131a5222edf.mp3", "Mi and I are in the same class.": "audio/cau/bc1a18955ee28275.mp3", "My bag is the same as yours, not different.": "audio/cau/b8e990694854227f.mp3", "Firefighters save people from burning buildings.": "audio/cau/455006b1a6cd17b8.mp3", "Lan saves money and keeps her savings in a box.": "audio/cau/cd1cde14a55133aa.mp3", "A doctor saves many lives every year.": "audio/cau/417adca2aed1e9ef.mp3", "Riding a bike saves money, so I save a lot.": "audio/cau/e232ebd2ab244e96.mp3", "I used my savings to buy a bike.": "audio/cau/e298ac7d3115952a.mp3", "She keeps her savings in a piggy bank.": "audio/cau/f3504c2469eb3f87.mp3", "My schedule is very busy this week.": "audio/cau/1ab9b35a3f31cfa1.mp3", "Make a timetable and follow your schedule.": "audio/cau/ff7294f58eece21c.mp3", "I search for information on the Internet.": "audio/cau/d7e038aa4772607c.mp3", "Let's search for the lost cat together.": "audio/cau/77e995f9494d2937.mp3", "You seem very tired today, Nam.": "audio/cau/35d0d317c3b0474d.mp3", "The test seems easy, but be careful.": "audio/cau/464d526b15ed996d.mp3", "Be your true self with your friends.": "audio/cau/6a8a3973764488e6.mp3", "He looks like his old self again.": "audio/cau/20f7eef1b2aa8b21.mp3", "I send my grandma a card every year.": "audio/cau/f7efced563dad922.mp3", "Please send me the photos by email.": "audio/cau/183c521730b080c9.mp3", "Let's sit in the shade of that tree.": "audio/cau/b1196dd8afa67a4c.mp3", "It is cool in the shade.": "audio/cau/df02a714abdaf1a4.mp3", "I share my snacks with my friends.": "audio/cau/1c625e89c3a3a49f.mp3", "Mi likes to share, so she shares her umbrella with Lan.": "audio/cau/c01233d4e9f84bef.mp3", "Let's go to the shop to buy a lamp.": "audio/cau/02d8310bb74af7bc.mp3", "There is a small shop near my house.": "audio/cau/e63a93ab9fc8033d.mp3", "My brother is short, but he plays basketball well.": "audio/cau/d8ddf117afef7434.mp3", "Minh is tall, but his brother is short.": "audio/cau/fa281035bc257ead.mp3", "There is a significant change in the weather.": "audio/cau/67863b502f69860b.mp3", "Mid-Autumn is a significant festival for children.": "audio/cau/74a1c5a832bdca70.mp3", "Use simple words in your presentation.": "audio/cau/685b89e962568275.mp3", "The task is simple; simply read and answer.": "audio/cau/f9dad5cdcce61ac9.mp3", "We sing English songs in class.": "audio/cau/026846f6b8826235.mp3", "Mi sang a song; she is a good singer.": "audio/cau/880ccad023e24637.mp3", "My sister wants to be a singer.": "audio/cau/8a321cf9c02f1183.mp3", "Who is your favourite singer?": "audio/cau/61920cc689201a93.mp3", "The cat has sleek black fur.": "audio/cau/3d6cc48367580f75.mp3", "This new phone has a sleek design.": "audio/cau/aa2a1b80f737688b.mp3", "The bus is slow at rush hour.": "audio/cau/732f025c97062de8.mp3", "Drivers should slow down near the school gate.": "audio/cau/80ba3032c253c920.mp3", "My house is small but cosy.": "audio/cau/361843b6d8177bed.mp3", "I live in a small flat, not a big house.": "audio/cau/e341afdae498f225.mp3", "Ha Noi is planning to become a smart city.": "audio/cau/534a2d2742fd455c.mp3", "My smart cousin made an app for smartphones.": "audio/cau/a451335c10c8aa7f.mp3", "He was smartly dressed for the party.": "audio/cau/88e290727a0dd91d.mp3", "She smartly solved the problem.": "audio/cau/7e41ccd8721cc114.mp3", "Many teenagers use a smartphone every day.": "audio/cau/5ebfc7f85b461743.mp3", "Nam's smartphone is smart: it can translate English.": "audio/cau/023fcc72924c361c.mp3", "I'm so pleased you won the prize!": "audio/cau/345d567c5208a7af.mp3", "It was raining, so we stayed at home.": "audio/cau/d3e8c1c4c40bf63a.mp3", "Our community has many social activities.": "audio/cau/fc1f110b171181c8.mp3", "Social media helps people in our society keep in touch.": "audio/cau/e92b2342d42803ab.mp3", "I socialise with my friends at weekends.": "audio/cau/dd123dc923d36197.mp3", "Clubs help students socialise with each other.": "audio/cau/0085823bd34a866e.mp3", "Teachers play an important role in society.": "audio/cau/2ef249973a563de3.mp3", "We should help the poor in our society.": "audio/cau/da4a1db62b47829f.mp3", "This is my favourite song.": "audio/cau/541e14c148c17e10.mp3", "Let's sing a song together!": "audio/cau/2582c08c2be3a294.mp3", "Rice is the main source of food here.": "audio/cau/5f77c2003c3e2a13.mp3", "The sun is a source of energy.": "audio/cau/66e109f678a6c63f.mp3", "Can you speak English well?": "audio/cau/7e70c8ed41dd5f73.mp3", "Mi spoke to her teacher after class.": "audio/cau/9631c4f9d08103cf.mp3", "Tet is a special time for Vietnamese families.": "audio/cau/5f60a4fd69577fbf.mp3", "Com is a speciality of Ha Noi, and it's very special.": "audio/cau/d7109b486b9421a3.mp3", "This doctor specialises in children's health.": "audio/cau/e280322fcd62af68.mp3", "The shop specialises in handmade gifts.": "audio/cau/708aef11332e67c9.mp3", "Bun cha is a speciality of Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/a2c2b048e7347b92.mp3", "This cake is special; it is a speciality of Hue.": "audio/cau/e7c18f248052be04.mp3", "Mum made this cake specially for me.": "audio/cau/bf39233106ef6ec0.mp3", "These shoes are specially made for running.": "audio/cau/b1829348d7039f13.mp3", "She spoke English very well.": "audio/cau/021d27ba9b445e58.mp3", "I spoke to my teacher after class.": "audio/cau/8a7ed13ad52bfd30.mp3", "The standard form of the first conditional uses \"will\".": "audio/cau/da711673e23e508c.mp3", "This is the standard size of a school desk.": "audio/cau/102a903896f43a9f.mp3", "Schools standardise the test for all students.": "audio/cau/489a98574b8d5fdd.mp3", "We need to standardise the size of the photos.": "audio/cau/8dfd2bec4b2bfc6e.mp3", "Our English lesson will start at eight.": "audio/cau/920ac7d03b952080.mp3", "We start at seven and finish at eleven.": "audio/cau/f8b0988a876acebc.mp3", "Good sleep keeps you in a healthy state.": "audio/cau/7049cd3c8f8cac73.mp3", "Exercise can improve your state of mind.": "audio/cau/694d7b4b952786de.mp3", "Read the statements and choose True or False.": "audio/cau/5f41d85ba1cc95cf.mp3", "The principal made a statement about the trip.": "audio/cau/9ca8f7090ffddefd.mp3", "We stay in tents at the summer camp.": "audio/cau/2e09709e31b8333c.mp3", "Mi will stay at home, but Nam will leave early.": "audio/cau/d5c48ac441b0c097.mp3", "We're staying at the Crazy House Hotel.": "audio/cau/a64a2e7aa9bd275a.mp3", "I'm staying with my grandparents this summer.": "audio/cau/9925267e92b40f5d.mp3", "Lan stays with her grandmother on Sundays.": "audio/cau/b44c1a677410d319.mp3", "He usually stays at home, but last week he stayed with us.": "audio/cau/066aab773dd2f3f9.mp3", "My phone doesn't have enough storage.": "audio/cau/3a5f01cbd2fd8f6f.mp3", "We use the attic for storage.": "audio/cau/b6d76a321b8d9aee.mp3", "The store is near our house.": "audio/cau/499a1bc50d7cd647.mp3", "Let's go to the store this weekend.": "audio/cau/df90dc123d86e998.mp3", "Mi is a student at Ba Dinh Secondary School.": "audio/cau/569937b828afcac4.mp3", "Every student must study hard for the test.": "audio/cau/88443b78f0da0120.mp3", "Mi studies English every evening.": "audio/cau/b1218f9b9530760b.mp3", "Nam studied hard last year, and now he studies even harder.": "audio/cau/9817881934cebf3a.mp3", "I study English every evening.": "audio/cau/2a98035816ae0fe1.mp3", "Hoa is a studious student; she likes to study maths.": "audio/cau/81fcae64bc4c3e71.mp3", "It was stupid to go out in the storm.": "audio/cau/0351acace7c0b0e1.mp3", "Don't call your friends stupid.": "audio/cau/990524047e4281cb.mp3", "She looks stylish in that dress.": "audio/cau/81c6a6ad4e83d0c9.mp3", "This is a stylish new phone.": "audio/cau/cc8322f4ab52e959.mp3", "Farmers supply rice to the city.": "audio/cau/aa2b237bdc8681d2.mp3", "Trees supply us with oxygen.": "audio/cau/38a69c382eaeb0cf.mp3", "Friends support each other in hard times.": "audio/cau/c25544ac51cf812c.mp3", "My parents are supportive; they always support me.": "audio/cau/bc09957a4f6cc0ae.mp3", "In \"don't\", the letter t comes from not.": "audio/cau/549e7bc5a2456c75.mp3", "I didn't go out because I was tired.": "audio/cau/5cc7479c1b749e64.mp3", "Don't forget to take your umbrella.": "audio/cau/d1c93b06561e343d.mp3", "I take the bus to school; yesterday I took a taxi.": "audio/cau/6de67298648ceb25.mp3", "This photo was taken in Hue.": "audio/cau/f504f1fe8bdf2bf6.mp3", "Have you taken your medicine?": "audio/cau/28798ff67a8368e9.mp3", "I often talk to my grandma on the phone.": "audio/cau/30262ea1745db608.mp3", "Lan is talkative; she loves to talk and chat with friends.": "audio/cau/ef14453a567466fc.mp3", "My little sister is very talkative.": "audio/cau/abe6afbd7c67a621.mp3", "He is shy, not talkative.": "audio/cau/c9c299a5fd04a0e9.mp3", "I talked with Lan about her well-balanced life.": "audio/cau/02abb2e169d7ed5a.mp3", "Minh talked to his teacher after class.": "audio/cau/54a184a8293b18ef.mp3", "Mai does the most important task first.": "audio/cau/a603b10339a760c3.mp3", "Cleaning the room is Nam's task today.": "audio/cau/ae2aa24fce0f8a61.mp3", "Our English teacher is very kind.": "audio/cau/4869000a32bce322.mp3", "Ms Hoa taught us maths last year; she is a great teacher.": "audio/cau/01cfa396481f53ff.mp3", "Can I use your telephone, please?": "audio/cau/aa7a5d67add41cf4.mp3", "Alexander Graham Bell invented the telephone.": "audio/cau/38ca1e3fa8439b54.mp3", "The temperature today is 35 degrees.": "audio/cau/4ccb7417e160f652.mp3", "The nurse took my temperature.": "audio/cau/2792d455a023f825.mp3", "The traffic in the city is terrible today.": "audio/cau/01ea841928344884.mp3", "The food was terrible, but the view was wonderful.": "audio/cau/93b659e2b5f66a2e.mp3", "Read the text and answer the questions.": "audio/cau/11d0eb5cbe887ed7.mp3", "The text is on page 20 of the textbook.": "audio/cau/d58a68e9e3987cad.mp3", "Open your textbook at page 20.": "audio/cau/915c1eaa49971a81.mp3", "I forgot my English textbook at home.": "audio/cau/a4a2d63649c29215.mp3", "Read the two texts and compare them.": "audio/cau/c807be1a6c25d189.mp3", "Mi sends me texts every day; this text is from her.": "audio/cau/2bea2a0f26cc7d4b.mp3", "The most important thing is to be honest.": "audio/cau/c302c847e8e66725.mp3", "Something is wrong; one thing is missing from my bag.": "audio/cau/c14d87bcc3d6fc9b.mp3", "I put my things in my schoolbag.": "audio/cau/bf35bafff88418e4.mp3", "There are many good things at my school, not just one thing.": "audio/cau/26ddc5ba45fd5524.mp3", "Tick the correct answers.": "audio/cau/03211fde6b6a3087.mp3", "Put a tick next to the things you did.": "audio/cau/579b575a47a252d1.mp3", "What time is it now, Mum?": "audio/cau/1cbca6b4e0afa66c.mp3", "Look at the timetable; it is time for maths.": "audio/cau/9b6fb48058293171.mp3", "Let's look at our new timetable.": "audio/cau/b37160eda36c9395.mp3", "We have Maths on Monday according to the timetable.": "audio/cau/46e65b162f79e5db.mp3", "Mum opened a tin of fish.": "audio/cau/5e651202e8c5abce.mp3", "We recycle old tins at school.": "audio/cau/d4330e1cfd8f5ea3.mp3", "I like swimming, and my sister likes it too.": "audio/cau/695ee0e76ca64b23.mp3", "This tea is too hot; I also want some water.": "audio/cau/641c64a35c7075e8.mp3", "I'm optimistic about the exam I took last week.": "audio/cau/98111979a0b1df4c.mp3", "Minh took the bus to school.": "audio/cau/d8fe913a07c52d8e.mp3", "A hammer is a useful tool.": "audio/cau/1a3c7f15d5f3bfcc.mp3", "The Internet is a great tool for learning.": "audio/cau/9937624454c78b12.mp3", "My phone has a touchscreen.": "audio/cau/53f0d254584fb99e.mp3", "Tap the touchscreen to start the game.": "audio/cau/ace3acece2cfb71a.mp3", "I have trouble with Maths.": "audio/cau/c804508f35a3217c.mp3", "Don't get into trouble at school.": "audio/cau/6705067f803b1778.mp3", "Is it true that Nam can sing well?": "audio/cau/b793f0302657ab80.mp3", "The story is true, not false.": "audio/cau/fd6a61c02d4b7fe6.mp3", "I'm truly sorry.": "audio/cau/e7ae5dcb584f8045.mp3", "It was a truly beautiful day.": "audio/cau/b7c3ef82c1d2475c.mp3", "Please tell me the truth.": "audio/cau/09d3635c1d77c2fb.mp3", "He always tells the truth.": "audio/cau/1b99124c4acee059.mp3", "Go straight and turn left at the corner.": "audio/cau/917966b2ec32c8a4.mp3", "A farm can turn food waste into biogas.": "audio/cau/52db34b37521af50.mp3", "This project turns food waste into energy.": "audio/cau/120924f8388b4ad5.mp3", "We turned old bottles into flower pots.": "audio/cau/36df7dee09156ada.mp3", "The old building looks unattractive.": "audio/cau/b241d830f1297168.mp3", "This plan is unattractive to young people.": "audio/cau/170c7efc82bb758c.mp3", "The shop assistant was unhelpful.": "audio/cau/72e4a1fc9b333f47.mp3", "This map is unhelpful.": "audio/cau/a647e15849c7448e.mp3", "Don't worry about unimportant things.": "audio/cau/f07810c695be3310.mp3", "This detail is unimportant.": "audio/cau/532d9addcc7fece9.mp3", "The writer of this song is unknown.": "audio/cau/34fd2674ae6ed3a3.mp3", "They travelled to unknown places.": "audio/cau/d5bf3d5c45b79db6.mp3", "That story is untrue.": "audio/cau/93e4988bfe2eafab.mp3", "Some news on the Internet is untrue.": "audio/cau/43deb053ae5f269d.mp3", "It's unusual to see snow in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/e05b05b1ff1ae1b4.mp3", "She has an unusual name.": "audio/cau/8b34ff4e430332df.mp3", "We gave our unwanted toys to poor children.": "audio/cau/954b10d86fbc304a.mp3", "Delete unwanted photos from your phone.": "audio/cau/43be7755bbdce39b.mp3", "Nam grew up in a small village.": "audio/cau/40830ead9e37bc73.mp3", "Lan walked up the hill and then came down.": "audio/cau/815acf6571d188ca.mp3", "We use computers to make our visual story.": "audio/cau/1f9e65093a2c0cf1.mp3", "This app is very useful, and I use it every day.": "audio/cau/7434eb2ec1577d85.mp3", "This dictionary is very useful.": "audio/cau/d616d82dd437efdf.mp3", "A computer is useful, but a broken one is useless.": "audio/cau/061aada006d6e574.mp3", "This broken umbrella is useless.": "audio/cau/87f4d5c1e27eee06.mp3", "It's useless to cry now.": "audio/cau/d2efa23c3f23f8b7.mp3", "Facebook has millions of users.": "audio/cau/3955ede83592bd40.mp3", "Enter your user name here.": "audio/cau/8f967e17a7ac312d.mp3", "My dad uses public transport to go to work.": "audio/cau/b4f5f66248fdebec.mp3", "Lan uses her bike every day because it is useful.": "audio/cau/7ec30a8c9f2617b2.mp3", "I got up at the usual time.": "audio/cau/290a01bde4a43987.mp3", "As usual, she was late.": "audio/cau/dbda02aadf09e9b8.mp3", "I usually get up at six o'clock.": "audio/cau/56d7578c4454be93.mp3", "Mi usually walks to school, so it is unusual for her to be late.": "audio/cau/3e33c944667515e1.mp3", "How about + V-ing? How about going to the park?": "audio/cau/4bd32e061c4f1188.mp3", "In the formula, V means a verb, like 'go' or 'play'.": "audio/cau/2a5961c55ebdeb37.mp3", "We visited various places in Hue.": "audio/cau/42d60322c6ac295a.mp3", "The club has various activities.": "audio/cau/1d3dc86bfeda3837.mp3", "'Play' is a verb, but 'happy' is not.": "audio/cau/7cb0163f6a27d0af.mp3", "Underline the verb in each sentence.": "audio/cau/c45fa8ec83b8ba93.mp3", "My school is very big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/5cd4ea7091dbf666.mp3", "Thank you very much for your help.": "audio/cau/162955bdaf4118ee.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is a vibrant city.": "audio/cau/cf80974d4e05d15d.mp3", "The painting has vibrant colours.": "audio/cau/0f1baf92e4a93ede.mp3", "Mi talks to Nick on a video call.": "audio/cau/7ffc18e81364c319.mp3", "We watch a video about stilt houses.": "audio/cau/2a7f65066f157bbb.mp3", "The hotel has great views of the sea.": "audio/cau/07916b977b3d0cbd.mp3", "Please share your views on this topic.": "audio/cau/820878ab3d1a09e0.mp3", "Nam was at home yesterday.": "audio/cau/faca1649a4ef8a76.mp3", "I was tired, but my friends were happy.": "audio/cau/e3e7c2c50296c48e.mp3", "Heavy traffic wastes our time.": "audio/cau/d348a074042968dc.mp3", "Nam wastes a lot of time on his phone.": "audio/cau/a7708f149da6124c.mp3", "We watch TV after dinner.": "audio/cau/8b47f4f4b321b7f8.mp3", "Nam is watching a film; his new watch is on the table.": "audio/cau/850cc4ddfbc726bf.mp3", "Trang watches films at the cinema at weekends.": "audio/cau/58771fac6bb56dc4.mp3", "My brother likes to watch football, and he watches it every Sunday.": "audio/cau/b5419c83106d199e.mp3", "They are watching a cartoon now.": "audio/cau/4d078d8c29b3de5f.mp3", "Phong likes watching football; he watches it every weekend.": "audio/cau/67283f87df189657.mp3", "This is the best way to learn new words.": "audio/cau/22b4d6bd5dcffca6.mp3", "Can you show me the way to the museum?": "audio/cau/a9eaac6ad2044743.mp3", "There are many ways to stay healthy.": "audio/cau/f79f902892e98e97.mp3", "Walking is a good way to keep fit.": "audio/cau/93a24eae327f3cdd.mp3", "Lan sings very well.": "audio/cau/8d831f0b90fa91ed.mp3", "Nam plays football well, but Phong plays better.": "audio/cau/7c13b2c077241009.mp3", "We went to the summer camp last June.": "audio/cau/577b7f143e454603.mp3", "Mi usually goes by bus, but yesterday she went by bike.": "audio/cau/bf4b0b541f770b47.mp3", "She is wearing a white T-shirt.": "audio/cau/2026d341ee2515db.mp3", "My cat is white, but my dog is black.": "audio/cau/6830d20c0f7fe4b8.mp3", "Why do you like this book?": "audio/cau/f853b0b3138e4625.mp3", "'Why are you late?' 'Because I missed the bus.'": "audio/cau/c4cf7bd9b30f00fd.mp3", "I will help you with your homework.": "audio/cau/09b1efdcdb577f02.mp3", "Lan will visit us tomorrow, but Nam won't come.": "audio/cau/b87ff8c1b6e3e1d4.mp3", "Please open the window, Nam.": "audio/cau/15a4f525e10bd63a.mp3", "There is a big window in my bedroom.": "audio/cau/26e9e97f7036367c.mp3", "We had a wonderful holiday.": "audio/cau/b731d7b223c248dd.mp3", "What a wonderful idea!": "audio/cau/83d5b6cb831dd9a7.mp3", "Write the new word in your notebook.": "audio/cau/8b8bb3be1461f910.mp3", "This word has two syllables.": "audio/cau/3c07a10113a0df79.mp3", "Learn five new words every day.": "audio/cau/adb2b8f5372e6050.mp3", "Match the words with the pictures, one word for each picture.": "audio/cau/0c015f99a499421d.mp3", "My parents work in a hospital in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/4a34bda1f13dc400.mp3", "My uncle is a hard-working worker; he works every day.": "audio/cau/4fe31bc354d9e0c5.mp3", "The worker wears a helmet.": "audio/cau/9c235c7e97cd46ce.mp3", "Factory workers work long hours.": "audio/cau/dd3d0d4cd13eb0b4.mp3", "My mum is working in the garden now.": "audio/cau/0fc0a939dbaf61f1.mp3", "Dad works hard, and today he is working late.": "audio/cau/8fff1884b3def435.mp3", "Lan's answer was wrong, so she tried again.": "audio/cau/1b25a01594f7e8c8.mp3", "You look sad, Minh. What's wrong?": "audio/cau/bde31146d26c8a31.mp3", "Lie becomes lying: change 'ie' to y and add -ing.": "audio/cau/ccd0d01ed2295121.mp3", "The word 'yellow' begins with the letter y.": "audio/cau/413244207833f8bd.mp3", "There are twelve months in a year.": "audio/cau/5ae786ad7493bc72.mp3", "This year, Mi is in Grade 9.": "audio/cau/6bad90fc27f44b2c.mp3", "My sister is twelve years old.": "audio/cau/28db75637c65c4ff.mp3", "He worked there for five years before he moved to Hue.": "audio/cau/eee3be2c2ba96ad1.mp3"};
